      "text": "不要再把 `ET发货单累计 < ET库存 + 历史销量` 写成“发货单缺采”,也不要用 `ET库存+历史销量` 反推供给下限。只能标为 `ET库存/销量匹配待核`,用于排查货号归并、销量或库存匹配问题。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b30e7c067f5be1a074c6_ccac4cf0f68f895682d9"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "162a7bf80f6bc4c45a8783fbcf785db97f480e29df92657d5400cd064ef6ed34",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T10:56:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.publish.02a7cbc74d2c",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "stores",
        "data_truth"
      ],
      "text": "不要再按旧记忆把OpenAPI描述成仅单店可用、待审核或默认关闭。旧的单店对账脚本与Windows单店定时入口只作历史诊断,不得替代当前19店正式能力与云端权威状态。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_417e24896a18de43c272_162a7bf80f6bc4c45a87"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "5dd577ffc73eb0d8428658a1c938f8e930e34a3c862337ec75d8f4e73d567c24",
      "explicitDurable": true,
